  <video:video><video:thumbnail_loc>https://globetape.github.io/thumbs/ukraine-front.jpg</video:thumbnail_loc><video:title>How Much of Ukraine Does Russia Control?</video:title><video:description>How much of Ukraine does Russia control? About 19% in November 2026, according to DeepStateMap: roughly 114,000 km², an area bigger than Portugal. We rewind the map to 2013 and watch the front line move, month by month.</video:description><video:player_loc>https://www.youtube.com/embed/FRN2bWGVwTU</video:player_loc><video:duration>37</video:duration><video:publication_date>2026-11-21T18:00:00Z</video:publication_date><video:family_friendly>yes</video:family_friendly></video:video></url>
<url><loc>https://globetape.github.io/videos/africa-size/</loc><lastmod>2026-11-20</lastmod>
