  <video:video><video:thumbnail_loc>https://globetape.github.io/thumbs/africa-size.jpg</video:thumbnail_loc><video:title>The True Size of Africa: US, India and EU Fit</video:title><video:description>What is the true size of Africa? On a Mercator map Greenland looks just as big, but Africa is 14 times larger: the mainland US, India and all 27 EU countries fit inside it at the same time, with almost half the continent to spare.</video:description><video:player_loc>https://www.youtube.com/embed/6WHdqIvEl5o</video:player_loc><video:duration>36</video:duration><video:publication_date>2026-11-20T18:00:00Z</video:publication_date><video:family_friendly>yes</video:family_friendly></video:video></url>
